## Research Conventions

- Write all research output to `docs/research/` as numbered markdown files
- Cite all sources with inline markdown links
- Use tables for comparisons
- Each file should stand alone with sufficient context
- Flag uncertainty explicitly
- When updating existing docs, add dated notes rather than silent edits

